 for details. </p>
<p class=3D"level0"><a name=3D"96"></a><span class=3D"nroffip">96</span> </=
p>
<p class=3D"level1">QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an S=
SL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers. </p>
<p class=3D"level0"><a name=3D"97"></a><span class=3D"nroffip">97</span> </=
p>
<p class=3D"level1">Proxy handshake error. </p>
<p class=3D"level0"><a name=3D"98"></a><span class=3D"nroffip">98</span> </=
p>
<p class=3D"level1">A client-side certificate is required to complete the T=
