<p class=3D"level0"><a name=3D"100"></a><span class=3D"nroffip">100</span> =
</p>
<p class=3D"level1">A value or data field grew larger than allowed. </p>
<p class=3D"level0"><a name=3D"XX"></a><span class=3D"nroffip">XX</span> </=
p>
<p class=3D"level1">More error codes might appear here in future releases. =
