ue in the project's bug tracker on GitHub: <a href=3D"https://github.com/cu=
rl/curl/issues">https://github.com/curl/curl/issues</a> </p><a name=3D"AUTH=
ORS"></a><h2 class=3D"nroffsh">Authors</h2>
